<div class="card mb-6">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h5 class="card-title">How to receive M-Pesa payments</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>
      To get paid by M-Pesa, paste four things from your own Paybill into the boxes below:
      your <strong>Paybill Number (Shortcode)</strong>, <strong>Consumer Key</strong>,
      <strong>Consumer Secret</strong>, and <strong>Passkey</strong>.
      Only you, as the paybill owner, can get the last three from Safaricom. Here is how:
    </p>
    <ol class="mb-3">
      <li>Have a Safaricom <strong>Paybill</strong>. No paybill yet? Get one from Safaricom first.</li>
      <li>Go to
        <a href="https://developer.safaricom.co.ke" target="_blank" rel="noopener">developer.safaricom.co.ke</a>
        and sign up. Use the phone number that owns your paybill.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>"Go Live"</strong> at the top, type in your Paybill number, and confirm with the code Safaricom texts you.</li>
      <li>Safaricom <strong>emails you your Passkey</strong>. Your <strong>Consumer Key</strong> and
        <strong>Consumer Secret</strong> are on the site under <strong>"My Apps"</strong>.</li>
      <li>Copy those four things into the boxes below. Done, you can now take M-Pesa payments.</li>
    </ol>
    <small class="form-text text-muted">
      Safaricom may take a day or two to approve. Too busy or stuck? Email
      <a href="mailto:M-PESABusiness@safaricom.co.ke">M-PESABusiness@safaricom.co.ke</a>
      or call <strong>0722 002 222</strong> and an agent will set it up and send you your passkey.
    </small>
  </div>
</div>
